    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Di dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe kabidi, muana wa muntu, ashila Tulo muadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ambila Tulo, udi mushikame ku tshibuelelu tshia ku mai manene, udi ngendʼa mushinga munkatshi mua bantu ha bungi badi mu maloba a ku muelelu wa mai manene, ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba ku Pelasa, Luda ne Puta bakadi mu tshisumbu tshia masalayi ebe, bakadi baluanganyi bebe ba nvita; bakakudika ngabu yabo ne bifulu biabo bia biamu ku bimanu biebe, bakalesha bakuabo butumbi buebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba ku Âwada ne ba ku Heleke bakadi ha mutu ha ngumbu yebe bua kutentekela nseke yonso, bantu ba ku Gamada bakadi mu bibumba biebe; bakakudika ngabu yabo ku bimanu biebe ku nseke yonso, bakavuisha bulengele buebe bulengele tshishiki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ku Tâshishi bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga bualu bua bintu biebe bivule bia mishindu yonso, bakashintakasha nʼebe biamu biabo bia argent, bia tshiamu tshifike, tshia étain ne tshia lutende ku bintu biebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ku Yawana, Tubala ne Mesheke bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga; bakashintakasha nʼebe bahika ne malonga a tshiamu tshia mitaku ku bintu biebe biwakenduluka nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Togâma bakashintakasha nʼebe tubalu tudi tuambula majitu, tubalu tua nvita ne nyama ya mpunda,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27.14:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dî dia mu français didi",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mulet",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ku bintu biebe biwakenduluka nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba ku Dedana bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga; bantu ba mu maloba mangi a ku muelelu wa mai bakakukuatshila mudimu bu bangendʼa mushinga; bakalua kûdi ne milambu ya mibanga ne mitshi ya ébéne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba ku Sulia bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga bualu bua bintu bivule biwakenza ku bianza biebe; bakashintakasha nʼebe mabue a grenat, bintu bia kuina nʼabi bilulu bikunze, bilulu biakadi ne malenda, bilulu bia lin bilengele, mabue a corail ne a rubis, ku bintu biwakenduluka nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Yuda ne ba mu buloba bua Isalele bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga; bakashintakasha nʼebe blé wa ku Minita, dihula, buitshi, manyi ne manyi a kulaba, ku bintu biwakenduluka nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Damaseke bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga bualu bua bintu bivule biwakenza ku bianza biebe, ne bua biuma biebe bikumbana bia mishindu yonso, bakendulukangana nʼebe mushinga bua nvinyo ya ku Helebone ne miosa mitoke ya mikoko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Uzala bakakuhanyisha tshiamu tshifike tshinonoke, casse ne roseau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27.19:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bintu bia muhuya muimpe biakelabo mu manyi a kulaba hamʼbidi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Dedana bakenduluka nʼebe mushinga bua mbulankete ya kuambika ha nyima ha tubalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Alaba ne bakokeshi ba mu Kedâ bakakukuatshila mudimu wa bungendʼa mushinga; bakakuhanyisha bana ba mikoko, bimpanga ne mbushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangendʼa mushinga ba ku Sheba ne Lama bakendulukangana nʼebe mushinga; bakashintakasha nʼebe bintu bia muhuya muimpe bitambe mushinga mukole, mabue a mushinga mukole matamba bulengele ne or, ku bintu biwakenduluka nʼabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba mu Halana, Kane, Edene, Sheba, Ashû ne Kilemada bakendulukangana nʼebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakendulukangana nʼebe mushinga bua bilulu bia mushinga mukole, tuzaku tufike tuakadi ne malenda mimpe, bilulu bia mibidi ya mushindu ne mushindu ne mionshi miluke bikole; bangendʼa mushinga bebe bakalua ne bintu ebi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matu a ku Tâshishi akatuala bintu biebe biwakenduluka nʼabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
